<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADR ENDS AT $56-1/8 (FIM 257.58).</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADR ENDS AT $56-1/8 (FIM 257.58).</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia's A share ADR fell $0-1/8 to $56-1/8 in New York on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Its Wall Street closing equals about 257.58 markka. In Helsinki on Wednesday Nokia A closed down 9.40 markka at 253.00.</p>
<p>Valmet's ADR (two shares) fell $0-1/4 to 32-3/4 on Wall Street on Wednesday. The price equals about 74.58 markka. In Helsinki, Valmet closed down 0.30 markka at 75.80.</p>
<p>Rauma's ADR ended $0-1/8 lower in New York on Wednesday. In Helsinki, Rauma closed flat at 86.00 markka.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245</p>
